%[text] ## Example 6: Finding Roots Using FZERO (Trigonometric-Logarithmic). 
%[text] ## Define the function  f(x) = log(x) \* sin(x)
%[text] ## 
%[text] **STEP 1 Define the function**
%[text] Use `@` to create an anonymous function.Define the function as `f(u)`.
f = @(x) log(x) .* sin(x);
%[text] **STEP 2 Use FZERO to find the root**
